    "Shifts bits left/right by a chosen amount at once (logical/arithmetic)": "指定した量だけビットを一度に左/右へシフトします（論理/算術）",
    "Electronic logic signal (voltage or current) which oscillates between a high and a low state at a constant frequency": "一定の周波数でハイとローの状態を行き来する電子論理信号（電圧または電流）",
    "Says whether A is less than, equal to, or greater than B": "A が B より小さいか、等しいか、大きいかを示します",
